{#- 작업지시서 PDF 기본 양식 (api-contract §9: WO 당 1페이지, WO QR 30×30 mm, 품목·규격·색상·가공방식·수량·도안·라우팅·발행 차수).
    WeasyPrint 렌더는 S1-5. 여기서는 플레이스홀더(admin #18)만 고정한다. -#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 15mm; }
  body { font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; }
  .qr { width: 30mm; height: 30mm; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #333; padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>작업지시서 {{ code }}</h1>
  <img class="qr" src="{{ qr_url }}" alt="{{ code }}">
  <p>수주 {{ so_code }} · 거래처 {{ customer_name }} · 납기 {{ due_date }}</p>
  <p>{{ item_name }} {{ spec }} {{ color }} · {{ print_method_name }} · 수량 {{ qty_ordered }}</p>
  {% if design_thumbnail_path %}<img src="{{ design_thumbnail_path }}" alt="도안">{% endif %}
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>공정</th><th>표준 리드타임(h)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for s in steps %}<tr><td>{{ s.process_name }}</td><td>{{ s.std_lead_hours }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>발행 {{ issue_no }}차 · {{ printed_at }}</p>
</body>
</html>
